# UBSan runtime suppressions for the sanitizer build, one finding per line,
# each with the reason. Matched against the function name. Remove a line
# once the finding is fixed: an unused suppression is silently ignored.

# tac_plus-ng/packet.c send_author_reply_final(), send_acct_reply():
# memcpy(p, NULL, 0) for an authorization or accounting reply without
# server_msg or data; memcpy's arguments are declared nonnull even for
# length 0.
nonnull-attribute:send_author_reply_final
nonnull-attribute:send_acct_reply

# tac_plus-ng/main.c compare_session(): the session tree of a connection
# compares two session ids as "a - b" in int; ids that differ by more
# than INT_MAX overflow. Needs two sessions open on one connection
# (single-connection); not seen to misorder the tree with three.
signed-integer-overflow:compare_session
